{"id":"rasch","lemma":"rasch","pos":"adv","rank":4091,"glosses":["quickly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/De-rasch.ogg/De-rasch.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er lernt rasch.","en":"He learns fast.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77839","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to learn","l":"lernen"},null]},{"text":"Dinge können sich rasch ändern.","en":"Things can change quickly.","words":[{"g":"thing","l":"Ding"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Hier ändert sich das Wetter sehr rasch.","en":"The weather changes very quickly here.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to change, to alter","l":"ändern"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"weather"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Rasch öffnete sie den Brief.","en":"She quickly opened the letter.","words":[null,{"g":"to open","l":"öffnen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"letter"}]},{"text":"Mein Vater überflog rasch die Zeitung.","en":"My father quickly scanned the newspaper.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},null,null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"newspaper"}]}]}